@startuml Penjadwalan Imunisasi Otomatis Berbasis Rule
!theme plain
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 300

title Sequence Diagram 4.4: Penjadwalan Imunisasi Otomatis Berbasis Rule (13 Vaksin IDL)

actor "Bidan" as Bidan
participant "View\n(AkunKeluargaCreate.jsx)" as View
participant "Routes\n(routes.go)" as Routes
participant "AnakController\n(anak.go)" as AnakController
participant "AnakUseCase\n(anak.go)" as AnakUsecase
participant "AnakRepository\n(anak_repository.go)" as AnakRepo
participant "ImunisasiUsecase\n(imunisasi_usecase.go)" as ImunisasiUsecase
participant "ImunisasiRepository\n(imunisasi_repository.go)" as ImunisasiRepo
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== 1. Bidan Menambahkan Data Anak Baru ==

Bidan -> View: Isi form tambah anak\n(nama, tanggal_lahir, ibu_id, dll)
activate Bidan
activate View

View -> Routes: POST /tenaga-kesehatan/anak/dengan-penduduk\nBody: CreateAnakDenganPendudukRequest
activate Routes

Routes -> AnakController: CreateDenganPenduduk(c)
activate AnakController

AnakController -> AnakUsecase: CreateAnakDenganPenduduk(req)
activate AnakUsecase

AnakUsecase -> AnakRepo: Create(anak)
activate AnakRepo

AnakRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO anak\n(kehamilan_id, penduduk_id, berat_lahir_kg,\ntinggi_lahir_cm, anak_ke, ibu_id)
activate DB
DB --> AnakRepo: anak.ID
deactivate DB
deactivate AnakRepo

== 2. Trigger Auto-Generate Jadwal Imunisasi ==

AnakUsecase -> ImunisasiUsecase: go onAnakCreated(anakID)\n**[Goroutine - Background Process]**
activate ImunisasiUsecase

note right of ImunisasiUsecase
  Callback ini didaftarkan di init.go
  m.Anak.SetOnAnakCreated(func(anakID int32) {
    m.GenerateJadwalImunisasiByAnakID(anakID)
  })
end note

ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiUsecase: GenerateJadwalImunisasiByAnakID(anakID)

== 3. Ambil Data Anak & Aturan Vaksin ==

ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: GetAnakByID(anakID)
activate ImunisasiRepo

ImunisasiRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM anak\nJOIN kependudukan ON anak.penduduk_id = kependudukan.id_kependudukan\nWHERE anak.id = ?
activate DB
DB --> ImunisasiRepo: anak (dengan tanggal_lahir)
deactivate DB
deactivate ImunisasiRepo

ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: GetAturanVaksinAnak()
activate ImunisasiRepo

ImunisasiRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM aturan_vaksin_anak\nORDER BY urutan
activate DB
DB --> ImunisasiRepo: []AturanVaksinAnak (13 rules)
deactivate DB
deactivate ImunisasiRepo

note right of ImunisasiUsecase
  **13 Vaksin IDL:**
  1. HB-0 (min_usia_hari: 0)
  2. BCG (min_usia_hari: 30)
  3. Polio 1 (min_usia_hari: 30)
  4. DPT-HB-Hib 1 (min_usia_hari: 60)
  5. Polio 2 (min_usia_hari: 60)
  6. DPT-HB-Hib 2 (min_usia_hari: 90)
  7. Polio 3 (min_usia_hari: 90)
  8. DPT-HB-Hib 3 (min_usia_hari: 120)
  9. Polio 4 (min_usia_hari: 120)
  10. IPV (min_usia_hari: 120)
  11. Campak (min_usia_hari: 270)
  12. MR 1 (min_usia_hari: 270)
  13. MR 2 (min_usia_hari: 540)
end note

== 4. Loop: Generate Jadwal untuk Setiap Vaksin ==

loop Untuk setiap rule dalam aturanList (13 kali iterasi)
    
    ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: IsJadwalExist(anakID, dosisVaksinID)
    activate ImunisasiRepo
    
    ImunisasiRepo -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM jadwal_imunisasi_anak\nWHERE anak_id = ? AND dosis_vaksin_id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> ImunisasiRepo: 0 (belum ada)
    deactivate DB
    deactivate ImunisasiRepo
    
    note right of ImunisasiUsecase
      **Hitung Tanggal Estimasi:**
      tanggalEstimasi = tanggalLahir.AddDate(0, 0, rule.MinUsiaHari)
      
      **Contoh:**
      - Anak lahir: 2026-06-24
      - HB-0: 2026-06-24 + 0 hari = 2026-06-24
      - BCG: 2026-06-24 + 30 hari = 2026-07-24
      - Polio 1: 2026-06-24 + 30 hari = 2026-07-24
    end note
    
    ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiUsecase: calculateStatusID(tanggalEstimasi)
    
    note right of ImunisasiUsecase
      **Hitung Status Jadwal:**
      diff = DATEDIFF(tanggalEstimasi, today)
      
      - diff >= 1 → Status 1 (Belum)
      - diff == 0 → Status 2 (Hari Ini)
      - -6 <= diff < 0 → Status 3 (Terlambat <7 hari)
      - -14 <= diff < -7 → Status 4 (Terlambat 7-14 hari)
      - diff < -14 → Status 5 (Terlewat)
    end note
    
    ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: CreateJadwalImunisasiAnak(jadwal)
    activate ImunisasiRepo
    
    ImunisasiRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO jadwal_imunisasi_anak\n(anak_id, dosis_vaksin_id,\ntanggal_estimasi, status_jadwal_id)\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)
    activate DB
    DB --> ImunisasiRepo: ID jadwal baru
    deactivate DB
    deactivate ImunisasiRepo
    
end

== 5. Update Status Jadwal ==

ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: UpdateJadwalStatus()
activate ImunisasiRepo

ImunisasiRepo -> DB: UPDATE jadwal_imunisasi_anak\nSET status_jadwal_id = \nCASE \n  WHEN DATEDIFF(tanggal_estimasi, NOW()) >= 1 THEN 1\n  WHEN DATEDIFF(tanggal_estimasi, NOW()) = 0 THEN 2\n  WHEN DATEDIFF(tanggal_estimasi, NOW()) >= -6 THEN 3\n  WHEN DATEDIFF(tanggal_estimasi, NOW()) >= -14 THEN 4\n  ELSE 5\nEND
activate DB
DB --> ImunisasiRepo: Updated (13 records)
deactivate DB
deactivate ImunisasiRepo

ImunisasiUsecase --> AnakUsecase: Generation Complete
deactivate ImunisasiUsecase

== 6. Response ke View ==

AnakUsecase --> AnakController: AnakResponse\n(data anak berhasil dibuat)
deactivate AnakUsecase

AnakController --> Routes: HTTP 201 Created\nJSON: {"message": "success", "data": {...}}
deactivate AnakController

Routes --> View: HTTP 201 Created\nJSON: {"message": "success", "data": {...}}
deactivate Routes

View --> Bidan: Tampilkan notifikasi:\n"✅ Data anak berhasil ditambahkan"
deactivate View
deactivate Bidan

note right of DB
  **Result:**
  - 1 record baru di tabel anak
  - 13 record baru di tabel jadwal_imunisasi_anak
  - Auto-generate berjalan di background
    (tidak memblokir response HTTP)
end note

@enduml
